Package: DataAudit
Type: Package
Title: Data Audit and Codebook for jamovi
Version: 0.1.1
Author: DataAudit contributors
Maintainer: DataAudit contributors <maintainer@example.com>
Description: Produces a teaching-friendly data audit and codebook for jamovi
